E OutlinerIntent                    | OutlinerSequence.h | 34-45  | contract                      | -  | What the interface asked the outliner to do. Never applied where it arrives; applied at ① of a tick. `RevisionSequence` like any other edit. Drag-reordering that mutated the relation directly would bypass undo, and its absence from the sequence is discovered by the artist rather than by a test.
    has   Enclose            OutlinerIntent  [-]  ?
